<!-- BACK + LABEL -->
<div style="position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:34px 40px 0">
  <a href="/projects" style="position:absolute;left:40px;top:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;color:#641822"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#641822" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 8H2M7 3L2 8l5 5"></path></svg>Back</a>
  <span style="font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#641822">Portfolio</span>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:0px auto 0;padding:88px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><h1 style="margin:0;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:60px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#641822">RSE Environnement</h1><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#8B5A61">Climate reports redesign in Power BI</p><p style="margin:26px 0 0;max-width:520px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Two projects on ENGIE’s environmental risk and climate vulnerability reports: a redesign of the climate page, then of the home pages of two reports.</p></div>
<!-- HERO IMAGE -->
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:56px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" src="images/rse-hero.webp" alt="Climate – Site report displayed on a laptop." width="1957" height="804" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px"></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:48px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px 40px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid #D9D2C7;border-bottom:1px solid #D9D2C7"><div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:8px">Role</div><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.45">Product Designer: audit, redesign, information hierarchy</div></div><div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:8px">Duration</div><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.45">Climate page: about one month. Home pages: October 2026, three weeks</div></div><div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:8px">Tools</div><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.45">Power BI, Figma, Jira</div></div><div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:8px">Context</div><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.45">ENGIE, work-study, two projects led on my own</div></div></div></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:88px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:12px">01 · CONTEXT</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#641822">Reports that present environmental data</h2><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">These reports present environmental risk and climate vulnerability data, for projects and for sites. They are used to present that data, and by the people who work with it.</p></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:120px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:12px">02 · PROJECT ONE</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#641822">A more attractive, more readable climate page</h2><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">The first project was the redesign of the climate page. The goal was to make it more attractive, more readable and easier to understand.</p><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">Some KPIs were added at the same time, so the organization of the cards had to be reviewed to stay ergonomic. The project lasted about a month.</p></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><a href="images/rse-climate.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="zoom" aria-label="Open the image full size in a new tab"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/rse-climate.webp" alt="The climate page before and after the redesign: indicators grouped by theme, in cards." width="1456" height="867" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto"></a></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:120px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:12px">03 · PROJECT TWO</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#641822">Refreshing the home pages</h2><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">The second project, completed in October 2026 over three weeks, was the redesign of the home page of two reports, for projects and for sites.</p><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">I audited the existing home pages on my own, to re-prioritize the elements and give the pages more energy. Navigation shapes became cards, grouped by theme, each with a short description of what it leads to.</p></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><a href="images/rse-project-home.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="zoom" aria-label="Open the image full size in a new tab"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/rse-project-home.webp" alt="Home page of the projects report, before and after the redesign." width="1456" height="415" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto"></a></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><a href="images/rse-sites-home.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="zoom" aria-label="Open the image full size in a new tab"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="images/rse-sites-home.webp" alt="Home page of the sites report, before and after the redesign." width="1456" height="412" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto"></a></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:120px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:12px">04 · RESULT</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#641822">Positive feedback</h2><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">Both projects received very good feedback.</p></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:120px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><h2 style="margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;color:#641822">What I take away</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px"><div style="flex:1 1 280px;min-width:0;border-top:2px solid #641822;padding-top:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500">A home page is a map: it should show what matters first and where each part leads.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 280px;min-width:0;border-top:2px solid #641822;padding-top:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500">Adding KPIs means rethinking the organization of the page, not only adding cards.</p></div><div style="flex:1 1 280px;min-width:0;border-top:2px solid #641822;padding-top:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500">Leading a project alone taught me to audit, prioritize and decide.</p></div></div></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:812px;margin:56px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#8B5A61;border-left:2px solid #D9D2C7;padding-left:16px">Some data is blurred or left out, because the reports are internal to ENGIE.</p></div>
<div style="width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:96px auto 0;padding:0px 24px 0;box-sizing:border-box"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5A61;margin-bottom:14px">Next project</div><a href="/gpc" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #D9D2C7;border-bottom:1px solid #D9D2C7;padding:28px 0;text-decoration:none;color:#641822"><div style="flex:1 1 360px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px">GPC 2.0</div><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;max-width:520px">An executive reporting product in Power BI, where I helped turn a Figma design into a report.</div></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px">View case study<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#641822" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h12M9 3l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></span></a></div>
</main>
<!-- CONNECT -->
</Layout>
